text = "[b]Goal:[/b] Score the most points by guessing where diseases were first identified.

[b]Setup:[/b] Choose 2 to 6 players. Everyone plays on this one computer.

[b]Each round:[/b]
1. A disease is named, and each player takes a turn in order.
2. When it's your turn, the others look away. Press [i]I'm ready[/i] and click the map where you think the disease was first identified.
3. Click again to move your pin. Press Confirm guess to finish your turn. Everyone sees the guesses after the last player confirms.

[b]Scoring:[/b] After everyone guesses, the real location appears in green. The closer your pin, the more points you get, up to 5,000 for a perfect guess.

[b]Learn:[/b] After each round, read where and when the disease was first identified and how it spread.

[b]Winning:[/b] After 5 rounds, the player with the most points wins."
fit_content = true

