bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b]Setup
After the main menu, you will be prompted to enter the names of every player.
Enter the names and confirm to begin the game.

The Game
There are 5 rounds:
1. Every round, you and the others will be shown the name of a disease.
2. The objective is to determine where in the world the disease was first identified.
3. You will take turns entering your answer by clicking to place a pin on the map.
- Before your turn, there will be a privacy screen with a confirmation prompt. Make sure no one else is looking so they don't cheat off of you!
4. Drag to pan and scroll to zoom. Click again to move your pin.
5. Press Confirm guess to finish your turn, then pass the device to the next player.
6. After the last player confirms, everyone sees the guesses and the correct location in green.
7. Alongside the answer, an educational fact about the disease is revealed. Be sure to remember them to help you out later!

Scoring
The closer your guess is to the disease's location, the more points you earn.

Winning
Remain as precise as possible to gain the most points. The player(s) with the most points win![/b]"

